{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-513", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/513", "wordCount": 2145, "segments": [{"start": 7.0, "text": "Hello, I'm Jonathan Davis,"}, {"start": 8.0, "text": "Web Technologies Evangelist for"}, {"start": 10.0, "text": "the Safari and WebKit Teams."}, {"start": 12.0, "text": "Welcome to \"Understanding CPU"}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "Usage with Web Inspector.\""}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "We all know that battery life is"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "important to users, and you"}, {"start": 20.0, "text": "probably instinctively know the"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "web browser is one of the"}, {"start": 23.0, "text": "most-used apps on our devices."}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "But beyond that, web content is"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "also incorporated into many"}, {"start": 30.0, "text": "popular iOS and macOS apps."}, {"start": 33.0, "text": "That means web content"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "significantly affects battery"}, {"start": 36.0, "text": "life for users, so making it"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "power-efficient has a big"}, {"start": 39.0, "text": "impact."}, {"start": 41.0, "text": "Safari and WebKit already"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "provide features to"}, {"start": 43.0, "text": "automatically save power for"}, {"start": 45.0, "text": "users when possible, such as"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "throttling timers when a webpage"}, {"start": 48.0, "text": "is in the background."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "And with support for content"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "blocker extensions, users can"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "automatically block loading"}, {"start": 55.0, "text": "unwanted content that's often"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "just junk slowing down their"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "browser, or worse, tracking"}, {"start": 59.0, "text": "them."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "But even with the built-in"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "power-saving features in Safari,"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "there's a lot left in the hands"}, {"start": 66.0, "text": "of web developers, so it's an"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "opportunity for all of us to"}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "improve performance and build a"}, {"start": 71.0, "text": "power-efficient web for users."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "The good news is that everything"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "you know about good performance"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "practices on the web also apply"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "as best practices for saving"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "power."}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "So all of the things we've heard"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "about improving page load time,"}, {"start": 87.0, "text": "optimizing JavaScript, and using"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "CSS animations and transitions"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "really help with battery life."}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "Whether you're experienced with"}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "all of the best practices for"}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "performance on the web, or just"}, {"start": 98.0, "text": "starting out, I'm going to show"}, {"start": 100.0, "text": "you a powerful new tool in Web"}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "Inspector that's going to give"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "you super powers for finding"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "where performance can be improved to save battery life."}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "It's called the CPU Usage"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "Timeline, and it's new in Web"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "Inspector in Safari 13 for"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "macOS."}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "It provides a window into power"}, {"start": 117.0, "text": "use that makes it easy to see"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "the impact of behaviors that"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "contribute to high CPU usage."}, {"start": 123.0, "text": "Today, I'm going to show you how"}, {"start": 125.0, "text": "to work with the new CPU Usage"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "Timeline, discover power issues"}, {"start": 129.0, "text": "through CPU Usage, and then I'll"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "briefly go over some strategies"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "for improving power savings in"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "your web-based projects."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "Now, before you can use the new"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "timeline, you'll need to enable"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "the Develop menu to access Web"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "Inspector."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "Just load up Safari Preferences,"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "and click on Advanced, and click"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "to enable to Show Develop menu"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "in menu bar option."}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "Now, just load up a webpage, and"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "open Web Inspector from the"}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "Develop menu, or use the"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "keyboard shortcut"}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "Command-Option-I."}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "I'm going to use the new CPU"}, {"start": 164.0, "text": "Usage Timeline to look for where"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "we can improve power on"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "webkit.org."}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "The homepage is pretty simple,"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "but it should be interesting,"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "because it still has some"}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "dynamic things happening, like"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "this subtle logo animation in"}, {"start": 175.0, "text": "the background."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "With Web Inspector open, click"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "over to the Timelines tab."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "In the upper left is a list of"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "different timelines."}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "There's a bunch of other timelines you can use, but the"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "defaults will work great to look"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "for ways to improve CPU usage."}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "To start a recording, you can"}, {"start": 197.0, "text": "click the red Record button, or"}, {"start": 199.0, "text": "press the Space bar, but I'm"}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "going to click the Reload"}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "button, which will automatically"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "start a recording and capture"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "page load, too."}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "When looking at CPU usage, it's"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "important to remember you'll"}, {"start": 211.0, "text": "want to record at least 15"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "seconds in order to get useful"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "measurements."}, {"start": 216.0, "text": "So I'll let this recording go a"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "bit beyond that to capture"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "enough data."}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "Now I'll scroll over the"}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "timeline to zoom out a bit so I"}, {"start": 223.0, "text": "can see everything."}, {"start": 227.0, "text": "Clicking on the CPU timeline,"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "you can see details about CPU"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "usage of the page."}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "At a glance, I can tell the page"}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "does a pretty good job of"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "keeping energy use low."}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "The quick load time helps a lot,"}, {"start": 239.0, "text": "and when the page becomes idle,"}, {"start": 241.0, "text": "the timeline shows the page is"}, {"start": 243.0, "text": "basically doing nothing."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "This is great, because it means"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "users can stay on the page all"}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "day, and the CPU drops to a very"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "low power state, with negligible"}, {"start": 251.0, "text": "battery drain caused by the web"}, {"start": 253.0, "text": "content."}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "The main thread is where a lot"}, {"start": 257.0, "text": "of interesting work happens for"}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "web content."}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "The main thread chart shows"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "different categories of work"}, {"start": 263.0, "text": "done on the main thread,"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "including JavaScript processing,"}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "painting, layout, and things in"}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "service of layout, like style"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "recalculation."}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "Based on this, we can see that"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "most of the time working was"}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "spent on painting."}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "In the middle of the indicator"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "is the time it took for the main"}, {"start": 278.0, "text": "thread to complete its work."}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "The entire recording was about"}, {"start": 282.0, "text": "20 seconds, but the main thread"}, {"start": 283.0, "text": "only took about 100 milliseconds"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "to complete its work."}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "Below the main thread chart is a"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "detailed breakdown of the CPU"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "usage across all of the threads"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "involved in doing work for the"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "web content."}, {"start": 295.0, "text": "I can take a closer look at this"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "by clicking and dragging in the"}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "timeline to select just the time"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "range where the work is being"}, {"start": 302.0, "text": "done."}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "And just under the CPU usage"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "graph, in this strip is the main"}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "thread indicator, which shows"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "categories of work that were"}, {"start": 311.0, "text": "happening on the main thread at"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "different points in time."}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "In this area of growing"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "activity, there were some layout"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "events in red, followed by"}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "significant painting work, just"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "like in the chart above, but"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "showing when it happened."}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "The energy impact gauge really"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "brings it all together, though."}, {"start": 329.0, "text": "It provides a score based on the"}, {"start": 331.0, "text": "total average usage across all"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "CPU cores for the selected time"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "range."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "The energy impact gauge is"}, {"start": 339.0, "text": "interactive, and as a total"}, {"start": 341.0, "text": "average, will change depending"}, {"start": 342.0, "text": "on the time range selected."}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "For the page load period, the"}, {"start": 346.0, "text": "gauge shows medium energy"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "impact, but loading is expensive"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "in terms of power, so that's"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "expected."}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "At least this stayed out of the"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "high range."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "That would've indicated a"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "problem but double-clicking the"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "timeline area to select the"}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "entire recording shows the"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "overall average CPU is low."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "I can click and drag the"}, {"start": 364.0, "text": "timeline to select a slice of"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "time out of the recording and"}, {"start": 368.0, "text": "watch the average change."}, {"start": 371.0, "text": "Now, when I click to grab the"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "selection, and slide it to a"}, {"start": 374.0, "text": "period where the page goes idle,"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "the energy impact drops to low."}, {"start": 378.0, "text": "That's really great."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "When the page is idle, we don't"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "want to be costing the user lots"}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "of power for content they're not"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "actively using."}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "The CPU use was in the low range"}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "while idle, even with the"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "rotating logo animation"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "happening in the background."}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "That's because it's using a"}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "simple CSS animation that makes"}, {"start": 396.0, "text": "it really cheap to animate, but"}, {"start": 398.0, "text": "it still gives the page a nice"}, {"start": 400.0, "text": "visual impact."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "Webkit.org is doing great so"}, {"start": 403.0, "text": "far, but when you're looking for"}, {"start": 405.0, "text": "power issues, looking at loading"}, {"start": 407.0, "text": "and idle are good starts."}, {"start": 409.0, "text": "To cover all of the bases, we"}, {"start": 410.0, "text": "need to capture some"}, {"start": 411.0, "text": "interactivity, too."}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "The WebKit Feature Status page"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "is a great way to stay up to"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "date on WebKit support for your"}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "favorite web features."}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "It allows you to filter and"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "search, and that's perfect for"}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "capturing interaction."}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "I'm going to record a timeline"}, {"start": 427.0, "text": "and interact with the page in"}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "some ways."}, {"start": 429.0, "text": "I'll just scroll down to the"}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "bottom, and then all the way"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "back up to the top, and then"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "I'll do a quick search, and"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "click on some things here and"}, {"start": 439.0, "text": "there. And again, we should at least"}, {"start": 442.0, "text": "capture 15 seconds."}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "Since we're on a new page, we"}, {"start": 446.0, "text": "should capture some period of"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "idle, too."}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "I'm going to let this continue"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "recording to get enough idle"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "time captured."}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "Okay, that looks pretty good."}, {"start": 459.0, "text": "Now I'm going to select the"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "entire recording and scroll to"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "zoom out of the timeline a bit"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "so we can see everything and"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "click to look at the CPU usage"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "details."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "Let's start digging into these"}, {"start": 475.0, "text": "areas, starting with loading."}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "The page managed to stay out of"}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "the high range during the quick"}, {"start": 481.0, "text": "load time, so we're okay there."}, {"start": 485.0, "text": "Now let's look at this range of"}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "interactivity."}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "The energy impact stays in the"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "medium range, even with all of"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "these things happening, but you"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "can tell from the JavaScript in"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "events timeline there's a lot of"}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "script firing while scrolling"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "and interacting."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "We definitely want to avoid"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "doing any extra CPU work while"}, {"start": 501.0, "text": "scrolling, since it's very"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "expensive to scroll."}, {"start": 504.0, "text": "Let's see if we need to be doing"}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "that work or not."}, {"start": 508.0, "text": "The Statistics and Sources"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "sections tell the story."}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "There were over 1200 entries"}, {"start": 513.0, "text": "into JavaScript for the selected"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "time in the recording, 596"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "request animation frame timers"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "fired, and there are 647 scroll"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "events."}, {"start": 522.0, "text": "Now, I know that reducing timers"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "and staying off of scrolling is"}, {"start": 525.0, "text": "better for performance, but we"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "need to look at the code to know"}, {"start": 527.0, "text": "if it's necessary or can be"}, {"start": 529.0, "text": "improved."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "In the Statistics area, you can"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "click on the timers or events to"}, {"start": 534.0, "text": "filter the sources on the right"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "to the code that triggered it,"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "and clicking the source takes"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "you right to the code in the"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "JavaScript Debugger."}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "Ah, OK, it looks like the"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "request animation frame timer is"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "calling updateImages, which"}, {"start": 549.0, "text": "iterates over all of the images,"}, {"start": 551.0, "text": "and checks if they are in view,"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "and if so, it loads them."}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "It's a pretty basic, lazy-loaded"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "images pattern, but this"}, {"start": 558.0, "text": "dimmed-out code in the debugger"}, {"start": 560.0, "text": "tells us inView and loadImage"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "are never called."}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "Even though we scrolled the"}, {"start": 565.0, "text": "entire page to the bottom, and"}, {"start": 567.0, "text": "back up to the top, it makes"}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "sense, though, because there's"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "basically no images on the page."}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "So the lazy-loading image code"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "shouldn't be firing at all on"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "this page."}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "Let's switch back to the code."}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "The images and the event"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "handlers are set up here."}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "So looking at the code, it's"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "just always setting up the event"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "handlers for scroll and resize"}, {"start": 587.0, "text": "all of the time."}, {"start": 589.0, "text": "To keep that from happening, we"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "just need to add a conditional"}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "guard."}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "There, let's try that."}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "OK, so let's capture a timeline"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "with the fix in place."}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "I'll click back over to the"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "Timelines tab, start a new"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "recording, and I'll do some"}, {"start": 610.0, "text": "quick scrolling."}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "You can already see there are no"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "JavaScript entries showing up in"}, {"start": 616.0, "text": "the timeline."}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "It's all just paint, so our"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "guard is working to prevent"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "extra JavaScript work while"}, {"start": 621.0, "text": "scrolling on a page without any"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "lazy-loaded images."}, {"start": 626.0, "text": "The energy impact has been"}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "reduced, and all of the main"}, {"start": 629.0, "text": "thread work is paints for"}, {"start": 630.0, "text": "scrolling, but we need to make"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "sure that the pages that should"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "be using lazy-loaded images are"}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "still working."}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "Again, with the fix in place,"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "I'll record a new timeline on a"}, {"start": 641.0, "text": "page with a MotionMark logo"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "image at the bottom that should"}, {"start": 644.0, "text": "use the lazy loader."}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "Perfect. The MotionMark image"}, {"start": 648.0, "text": "loaded in."}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "I'm going to scroll to get some"}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "CPU measurements of the new"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "behavior and click the CPU"}, {"start": 654.0, "text": "Timelines to see where we're at."}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "So we've reduced the timer and"}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "events to just the pages where"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "it's necessary."}, {"start": 663.0, "text": "That's great, but there's still"}, {"start": 666.0, "text": "a lot of entries into Script"}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "when scrolling on pages with a"}, {"start": 669.0, "text": "lazy-loaded image."}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "There's an API available in"}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "Safari that we can use to take"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "this solution a step further."}, {"start": 676.0, "text": "We can replace the request"}, {"start": 677.0, "text": "animation frame implementation"}, {"start": 679.0, "text": "to use Intersection Observer"}, {"start": 680.0, "text": "instead."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "Intersection Observer can tell"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "when an element comes into view,"}, {"start": 685.0, "text": "so you can limit your work to"}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "just when it's visible."}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "And as soon as it goes out of"}, {"start": 689.0, "text": "view, you can stop the work to"}, {"start": 691.0, "text": "get back to a low CPU power"}, {"start": 693.0, "text": "state and save power."}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "So with the Intersection"}, {"start": 697.0, "text": "Observer implementation, let's"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "record another timeline, and do"}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "some scrolling to see how this"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "solution performs."}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "And as I begin scrolling,"}, {"start": 705.0, "text": "there's just a single entry into"}, {"start": 706.0, "text": "JavaScript, and for the rest of"}, {"start": 708.0, "text": "the time, it's just painting"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "while I scroll."}, {"start": 717.0, "text": "So in the end, we went from"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "16.3% down to 9-1/2% average CPU"}, {"start": 722.0, "text": "usage with the Intersection"}, {"start": 723.0, "text": "Observer solution."}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "Every little bit helps, and"}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "that's a really nice"}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "improvement."}, {"start": 728.0, "text": "So there are lots of ways to"}, {"start": 730.0, "text": "save power in web content."}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "Use the CPU usage timeline to"}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "investigate web content for ways"}, {"start": 737.0, "text": "to improve during interactivity"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "and when the page is idle."}, {"start": 741.0, "text": "Remember that reducing CPU usage"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "saves energy and reduces battery"}, {"start": 744.0, "text": "drain for users."}, {"start": 747.0, "text": "CSS animations and transitions"}, {"start": 749.0, "text": "can provide dynamic visuals"}, {"start": 751.0, "text": "without the power cost and try"}, {"start": 754.0, "text": "to avoid doing work while"}, {"start": 755.0, "text": "scrolling."}, {"start": 756.0, "text": "Using the Intersection Observer"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "API instead."}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "Users want an engaging, dynamic"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "experience with web content, but"}, {"start": 763.0, "text": "the best version of those"}, {"start": 764.0, "text": "experiences use the least amount"}, {"start": 765.0, "text": "of CPU possible."}, {"start": 768.0, "text": "There are a lot more"}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "power-saving tips for web"}, {"start": 770.0, "text": "development on the WebKit Blog."}, {"start": 772.0, "text": "Check out the links in the"}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "resources section associated"}, {"start": 775.0, "text": "with this video."}, {"start": 777.0, "text": "We hope you'll try using these"}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "tools on your web content, and"}, {"start": 780.0, "text": "use the advice in this video as"}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "some starting places for your"}, {"start": 783.0, "text": "investigations on how to make"}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "your web content power"}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "efficient, and join us in"}, {"start": 788.0, "text": "helping the web become more"}]}
